{
  "key": 40231,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_Placeholder",
      "en_US": [
        "The Sanctuary is quiet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_SpeakerA",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome. Sit anywhere.\r",
        "Nobody here will tell you to let\n",
        "go. Hold on as tight as you like.\r",
        "Team Eclipse is working on the\n",
        "rest."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_HallAttendantA",
      "en_US": [
        "Tea's at the back. Cards are by\n",
        "the door, if you want one.\r",
        "Write a name. Pin it on the wall\n",
        "outside. It helps."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyAA",
      "en_US": [
        "I stood up and talked about my\n",
        "wife last night.\r",
        "Forty minutes. Nobody looked at the\n",
        "clock.\r",
        "I didn't know I had forty minutes\n",
        "in me."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyBA",
      "en_US": [
        "My Luxray. Eight years together.\r",
        "People say it was just a\n",
        "Pokemon.\r",
        "Nobody here says that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyCA",
      "en_US": [
        "My grandpa taught me to fish.\r",
        "They said when he comes back, he\n",
        "can teach me the rest.\r",
        "I'm saving the hard parts for him."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_RecordsClerkA",
      "en_US": [
        "Every card on the wall has a twin\n",
        "in here.\r",
        "We copy them all into the ledger.\n",
        "In case the rain gets them.\r",
        "The registrar is very particular.\n",
        "Every name. Every detail."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_SpeakerB",
      "en_US": [
        "Welcome. Sit anywhere.\r",
        "Don't mind the guards. Someone\n",
        "broke into our depot.\r",
        "Grief makes people do strange\n",
        "things. Even steal."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyAB",
      "en_US": [
        "They locked the back rooms. Fine.\n",
        "I only need the bench."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyCB",
      "en_US": [
        "Professor Rowan said it might be\n",
        "possible!\r",
        "I'm telling Grandpa the second he's\n",
        "back."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_HallGruntB",
      "en_US": [
        "Records office is closed. Staff\n",
        "only.\r",
        "The hall's open. Sit down. Have\n",
        "some tea."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_BackDoorGruntB",
      "en_US": [
        "That door's for staff. Always has\n",
        "been."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_SpeakerC",
      "en_US": [
        "The professor was frightened. That\n",
        "is all.\r",
        "Frightened men take things back.\r",
        "We don't. We keep everything."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyBC",
      "en_US": [
        "The professor said not to let his\n",
        "name sell their promise.\r",
        "I keep thinking about how they'd\n",
        "bring my Luxray back.\r",
        "What would it cost? Who would pay\n",
        "it?\r",
        "I'm going home."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TestimonyCC",
      "en_US": [
        "Mom says the professor was wrong.\r",
        "I don't care. I'm saving the hard\n",
        "parts for Grandpa."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LookerR_1",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Not now. I am reading.\r",
        "This registrar keeps very good\n",
        "records. Too good."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LookerR_2",
      "en_US": [
        "Looker: Go. The door under the\n",
        "ruins. I will find you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LastBelieverE",
      "en_US": [
        "I came to say my piece anyway. Like\n",
        "every evening.\r",
        "Forty minutes about my wife.\r",
        "...Nobody's at the lectern. I'll\n",
        "just talk to the bench."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_IpOfficerHallE",
      "en_US": [
        "We're cataloguing everything. It'll\n",
        "take weeks.\r",
        "They kept a file on every person\n",
        "who ever cried in here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_IpOfficerOfficeE",
      "en_US": [
        "The registrar's office. She left in\n",
        "a hurry, but nothing was out of\r",
        "place. Not one card."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_ReadingKeeperF",
      "en_US": [
        "I copied every card into that\n",
        "ledger. I thought I was helping.\r",
        "Now I give them back. One family at\n",
        "a time.\r",
        "It's slower. It's better."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LecternABC",
      "en_US": [
        "A lectern with a black sun carved\n",
        "in the front.\r",
        "A note on it: TONIGHT, SHARE ONE\n",
        "MEMORY. THAT'S ALL."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LecternE",
      "en_US": [
        "The lectern is wrapped in police\n",
        "tape."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_LecternF",
      "en_US": [
        "The black sun has been sanded off.\n",
        "Someone carved a flower instead."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_NoticeBoardABC",
      "en_US": [
        "GRIEF CIRCLE, EVERY EVENING.\r",
        "Tea after. Everyone welcome."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_FilingDrawersA",
      "en_US": [
        "Drawer after drawer of cards. Each\n",
        "one has a name, a date, a place."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_FilingDrawersE",
      "en_US": [
        "The drawers are empty. Police\n",
        "labels on every one."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_FilingDrawersF",
      "en_US": [
        "The drawers are open. A note:\r",
        "TAKE YOUR CARD HOME IF YOU WANT\n",
        "IT. ASK AT THE DESK."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_TheLedgerA",
      "en_US": [
        "A thick ledger. Names, dates and\n",
        "places, in neat rows.\r",
        "There's a fourth column, in smaller\n",
        "writing.\r",
        "The clerk closes the book before\n",
        "you can read it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_IndrasDeskA",
      "en_US": [
        "A tidy desk. One card on it, not\n",
        "filed yet:\r",
        "TEO. The date is written in.\r",
        "The place is left blank."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_IndrasDeskE",
      "en_US": [
        "The desk is bare. The police took\n",
        "everything but the chair."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_BackDoorA",
      "en_US": [
        "STAFF ONLY."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_BackDoorBCDR",
      "en_US": [
        "STAFF ONLY. KEEP OUT.\r",
        "It's locked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_BackDoorE",
      "en_US": [
        "Police seal. It's locked."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "SolaceonSanctuary_Text_BackDoorF",
      "en_US": [
        "Bricked up. Someone has chalked a\n",
        "flower on the bricks."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
